--- !u!114 &8364538
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8364536}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8e53287d76a0f7f418ae0767649c5267, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  noteText: 'Assignment:

    Blow up the Rubble by applying an explosion force to
    all the rigidbodies within a certain radius of the dynamite and play the dynamite''s
    explosion effect!


    Optional: add an explosion sound effect


    Note:

    DON''T
    apply the changes to any of the Prefabs because it will mess up all the other
    demo scenes. Although in a real life scenario, you would apply the changes OR
    create prefab variants, in this case it also allows you to clearly see the CHANGES
    done in a Scene, with respect to the base prefab.'
  noteType: 0
